{
  "$comment": "Chrome icon packs. tools/gen_icon_packs.py fetch downloads these pinned npm releases, verifies their integrity and copies only the listed icons (and each license) into this directory; the build compiles them into the module. Order is KrIconPack: the first pack, Fluent System Icons, is the default, and a role absent from any other pack falls back to it. Radix ships React components, so its paths are read from the package's bundled module.",
